    ‖ratComplexValue (lowZeroCoefficientsP2J1I7K4State 0)-
      complexPowerExpAtom (complexThetaExponent lowZeroSeedP2J1I7K4Point)
        (Real.pi*(4:ℝ)^2) (((31:ℚ)/8):ℂ)‖≤
